From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SWEEP-Bench <sweep-bench@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Lock the training environment

pyproject.toml pins the versions of the paper's runs and uv.lock records
them, so `uv sync --frozen` rebuilds the environment. torch comes from the
cu128 index; torchcodec is optional.
---
 .python-version |    1 +
 pyproject.toml  |  129 ++-
 uv.lock         | 2544 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 2673 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 .python-version
 create mode 100644 uv.lock

